###	1 找出Comp. Sci.系开设的具有3个学分的课程名称。（请将'Comp. Sci.'复制到查询的条件中）
```sql
SELECT title
FROM course
WHERE dept_name = 'Comp. Sci.' 
  AND credits = 3;
```

