### 6 找出在2009年秋季拥有最多选课人数的课程段。
```sql
SELECT course_id, sec_id, semester, COUNT(ID) AS enrollment
FROM takes
WHERE year = 2009 AND semester = 'Fall'
GROUP BY course_id, sec_id, semester
HAVING COUNT(ID) = (
    SELECT MAX(enrollment)
    FROM (
        SELECT COUNT(ID) AS enrollment
        FROM takes
        WHERE year = 2009 AND semester = 'Fall'
        GROUP BY course_id, sec_id
    ) AS enrollment_counts
);
```

