### 10 从前述查询（i）中所计算出的每个系最高工资中选出最低值 
```sql
SELECT MIN(max_salary) AS min_of_max_salaries
FROM (
    SELECT dept_name, MAX(salary) AS max_salary
    FROM instructor
    GROUP BY dept_name
) AS dept_max_salaries;
```
